THIRD-PARTY NOTICES

This package bundles the following third-party components:

1. libde265 (@yume-chan/libde265) — LGPL-3.0
   The H.265/HEVC decoding kernel is licensed under the GNU Lesser General
   Public License v3.0. It is distributed here as a WebAssembly module bundled
   into the built JavaScript output.

